      "mode": "build_from_scratch",
      "template": null
    },
    "prompt_template": "You are implementing \"$task_name\" using $framework $framework_version on\n$language $language_version. The project lives in the current directory\n($workdir), which may contain a stack-provided starter project.\n\n$description\n\nFunctional requirements:\n$functional_requirements\n\nTechnical requirements:\n$technical_requirements\n\nEnvironment:\n$environment_notes\n\nWhen you are done, the API will be started with `sh start.sh` and checked by\nan automated HTTP test suite against exactly the requirements above.\nWork autonomously until the implementation is complete. Do not ask questions.",
